{"chars": "There was a crystal bowl, so clear that it seemed to be made of ice. There were her six treasures from the journey: five little glass bottles, corked and labeled in her neat handwriting, and one paper envelope holding a silver-veined leaf. There was a little jug of fresh water from the melt ponds on the sea ice, where the summer snow had melted into puddles as blue as a robin's egg. There was a jar of golden honey from her greenhouse bees. And there was one of her aurora lanterns from the greenhouse, glowing softly with its wisp of captured northern light.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.463, 0.463, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.55, 0.95, 0.95, 0.95, 0.95, 0.95, 1.5, 1.613, 1.613, 1.613, 1.887, 1.887, 1.887, 1.887, 1.887, 1.887, 2.225, 2.225, 2.225, 2.225, 2.225, 2.337, 2.337, 2.337, 2.475, 2.475, 2.475, 2.475, 2.475, 2.475, 2.475, 2.712, 2.712, 2.712, 2.788, 2.788, 2.788, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 3.112, 3.112, 3.112, 3.2, 3.2, 3.2, 3.2, 3.95, 4.05, 4.05, 4.05, 4.05, 4.05, 4.05, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 5.225, 5.225, 5.225, 5.225, 5.225, 5.362, 5.362, 5.362, 5.362, 5.463, 5.463, 5.463, 5.463, 5.463, 5.463, 5.463, 5.463, 6.075, 6.188, 6.188, 6.188, 6.188, 6.188, 6.487, 6.487, 6.487, 6.487, 6.487, 6.487, 6.487, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.8, 7.912, 7.912, 7.912, 7.912, 7.912, 7.912, 7.912, 8.3, 8.3, 8.3, 8.3, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.938, 8.938, 8.938, 8.938, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 10.125, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.35, 10.35, 10.35, 10.35, 10.575, 10.575, 10.575, 10.575, 10.575, 10.575, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 11.4, 11.4, 11.4, 11.4, 11.4, 11.4, 11.4